            "overlay_texts": [
                "Taro&#039;s stethoscope hangs unused at his sternum as he halts before the Slag reservoirnot because of sight, but because his Vitalis bond, tuned since childhood to the congregational broadcasts of his patients, catches something it has never processed: a frequency neither living nor dead, but suspended between them, the acoustic register of interrupted consciousness, a tearful stutter in the biological substrate. Young man with lean athletic build, sharp youthful features, pale blue eyes with calm detached presence, tousled white-blueish layered hair with soft metallic highlights. Red cropped matte-leather jacket with high open collar, white piping, exposed brushed steel zipper, reinforced quilted shoulder panels, small stitched geometric patch on left shoulder, tiny snap studs catching dim light. Lightweight gray crew shirt beneath, geometric diamond-shaped silver pendant at chest. Black fingerless gloves with reinforced knuckles and visible scuffing. Slim dark charcoal tactical pants with articulated knee seams, thin reflective piping along outer thighs, low-profile utility belt with hex buckle, subtle fabric creases showing natural stance. Black matte-leather boots with reinforced toe caps and lug soles. Sparklefly dims entirely, landing on his shoulder without her usual luminescencea voluntary silence never witnessed in twelve years of partnership. Her translucent crystalline body, usually alive with glowing golden-orange aura and intricate geometric patterns, now rests darkened and still, a small silhouette against the red jacket. Taro holds his palm six centimeters from the black surface of the Slag, broadcasting his healer&#039;s signature unstintingly, watching the boundary ripple toward his heatnot with voracity, but with the fragile approach of the deeply, lethally fevered reaching for coolness. The realization settles into him like pond sediment: the city&#039;s foundation is graven from the bodies of those who could not say no. He retraces his hand, files this condolence in a compartment of his mind he cannot afford to excavate, and walks oneach footfall a deliberate tread across haunted ground. Cinematic anime illustration style, semi-realistic proportions, high-quality linework, cell and soft shading hybrid, volumetric atmosphere around the reservoir, dark ominous lighting reflecting off black Slag surface, cool undertones contrasting warm red jacket, no motion blur, full bodies visible in composition. The weight of conscious, muted remains beneath each step transforms the scene into intimate tragedyTaro&#039;s lived-in tactical wear and Sparklefly&#039;s unprecedented darkness anchor the moment between compassion and horror."
            ],
